\section{Board of Directors Election --- Explanation and Procedures}

\begin{center}
{\large\bfseries\color{navyblue} {{ association_name | tex_escape }} }\\[4pt]
{\large {{ meeting_year }} Board of Directors Election}
\end{center}

\vspace{0.15in}

\subsection*{Why an Election Is Held}

The Association holds annual elections for its Board of Directors in accordance with its governing documents.
{% if election.staggered_terms %}
Director terms are staggered so that not all seats expire in the same year, which ensures continuity
of governance.
{% endif %}
At the {{ meeting_year }} Annual Meeting, unit owners will elect
\textbf{{{ election.seats_up_count or 1 }} director(s)}.

{% if election.director_term_length_years %}
\vspace{0.1in}
\noindent Each director elected at this meeting will serve a \textbf{{{ election.director_term_length_years }}-year term}
beginning upon election.
{% endif %}

