\subsection*{Nomination Procedures}

{% if jx.nomination_notes %}
{{ jx.nomination_notes | tex_escape }}
{% else %}
Nominations for the Board of Directors may be submitted in writing in advance using the nomination form
included in this packet, or may be made from the floor at the Annual Meeting.
{% endif %}

{% if election.nomination_from_floor %}
\vspace{0.1in}
\noindent Nominations from the floor will be accepted at the Annual Meeting.
Any eligible unit owner present at the meeting (or represented by proxy) may nominate
a qualified unit owner for election.
{% endif %}

\subsection*{Voting Procedure}

Voting will be conducted at the Annual Meeting. Each unit is entitled to \textbf{one (1) vote}.
Unit owners may vote in person or by proxy.
{% if election.ballot_required %}
A written ballot will be distributed at the meeting.
{% else %}
Voting may be conducted by voice vote, show of hands, or written ballot at the discretion
of the presiding officer.
{% endif %}

\begin{notebox}
\textbf{Proxy Reminder:} Unit owners unable to attend the Annual Meeting in person may vote
in the board election by submitting a valid proxy. See the Proxy Form included in this packet.
\end{notebox}

